#describe what Clears the 11 open CodeQL alerts by removing the flagged patterns, with no suppression comments and no workflow change.
#describe what Comment and tag stripping scans instead of using regexes, and one innerHTML assignment now sets text.
#describe before A marker rebuilt by removing a comment could stay visible, and a typed folder path was read as HTML in the Skills window.
#describe after Comments are removed until none is left, and the folder path is shown as text.
#describe verified typecheck, lint, the whole test suite and the lantern-setup skill test pass; CodeQL itself only runs on the pull request.
