#reason test/website-tags.test.ts Pins what the docs tag remover keeps and that nothing is left to strip on a second pass
#reason website/src/lib/tags.ts Holds the dependency-free tag scanner so root tests can import it without the site's packages
#reason skills/lantern-setup/scripts/prdescribe.mjs Strips comment markers by scanning so a marker rebuilt by removing a comment cannot slip through
#reason src/main/lantern-describe-parse.ts Same comment stripping as the skill copy, so the app and the validator keep showing identical text
#reason src/main/settings-model.ts Replaces every newline in the empty-settings text, not only the first
#reason src/renderer/features/skills.ts A typed folder path was parsed as HTML in the setting-up message, so it is now set as text
#reason test/integration-skills-standalone.test.ts Matches the Jira host by parsed origin instead of a string prefix
#reason test/lantern-macro-eval.test.ts Finds a check's status by comparing tokens, so no regex escaping is needed
#reason test/lantern-pr-describe-card.test.ts Checks the hidden strings one by one instead of with a tag-matching regex
#reason test/lantern-pr-parity.test.ts Pins the comment cases that defeated the old regexes and decodes paths properly
#reason test/skills-modal.test.ts Proves a hostile folder path shows as text and creates no element
#reason website/src/lib/headings.ts Uses the tag scanner instead of a tag-stripping regex when building heading text
#story Pull request descriptions hide host markers for good
